  "$comment": [
    "Two 74HC595s on shared clocks, the first's QH' on the second's SER (the datasheet's cascade), /OE low, /SRCLR high, every output on a 10 k load.",
    "Sixteen bits are shifted in one SRCLK pulse per two 0.5 ms phases; RCLK pulses after the 8th, 12th and 16th. After eight clocks the first bit reaches QH' and starts into the second chip; after sixteen it is stored in the second chip's QH. The digital slots of both chips (QH' included) and every output net are compared at each phase end."
